            "heading": "Electric Breast Pumps",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_rDzkTQ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Ameda's <a href=\"https://www.ameda.com/products/ameda-mya-joy-hospital-strength-portable-electric-breast-pump\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">electric breast pumps</span></a> are designed for maximum efficiency and ease of use. With powerful suction and customizable settings, these pumps allow moms to express milk comfortably and quickly. Our electric pumps are ideal for moms who need to pump frequently or are looking for a reliable solution for use at home or on the go. These pumps come equipped with multiple suction levels and speeds, allowing you to personalize your pumping experience for optimal comfort and effectiveness. Whether you're establishing your milk supply or maintaining it, Ameda's electric breast pumps are here to support you throughout your breastfeeding journey. The portability and reliability of our electric models make them a trusted choice for many moms.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
