            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_djDRF9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><a href=\"https://www.ameda.com/products/ameda-mya-joy-plus-rechargeable-quiet-and-portable-double-breast-pump\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Double breast pumps</span></a> allow you to pump both breasts simultaneously, which can save time and help boost milk production. Ameda's double breast pumps are designed to provide efficient and comfortable pumping sessions, helping busy moms make the most of their time while ensuring that they can provide enough milk for their babies. By using a double pump, you can cut pumping time in half compared to single pumping, which is especially beneficial for moms with tight schedules. Additionally, double pumping has been shown to help increase milk output by stimulating both breasts at once, which can be particularly useful when trying to build or maintain a healthy milk supply. Ameda's double pumps are crafted with comfort in mind, featuring adjustable settings that allow you to customize your pumping experience.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
