      ],
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<h2>The Benefits of Using Ameda Breast Pumps</h2>\n<p>At Ameda, we offer a variety of breast pumps to meet the needs of every mom. As the pioneers of hospital-grade breast pumps, we pride ourselves on providing products that are comfortable, efficient, and designed to fit seamlessly into your life, whether you’re at home, on the go, or in a hospital setting.\n</p>",
