    "help_links_DHXdie": {
      "type": "help-links",
      "blocks": {
        "link_DxVWet": {
          "type": "link",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Suction & Comfort",
            "icon": "",
            "content": "",
            "custom_liquid": "<p>Suction power is a key consideration when choosing a breast pump, as it directly affects both comfort and efficiency. Ameda breast pumps feature adjustable suction settings, allowing you to customize the pressure to your comfort level&mdash;a particularly helpful feature for new moms getting accustomed to pumping.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.ameda.com/products/ameda-mya-joy-plus-rechargeable-quiet-and-portable-double-breast-pump\">Double electric breast pumps</a> provide more powerful suction compared to single electric or <a href=\"https://www.ameda.com/products/ameda-portable-manual-breast-pump\">manual pumps</a>, making them ideal for moms who pump frequently. For those needing extra support, Ameda&rsquo;s hospital-grade pumps offer advanced suction technology that mimics a baby&rsquo;s natural nursing rhythm, delivering a more comfortable and effective pumping experience.</p>\n<p>Comfort is at the heart of Ameda&rsquo;s design. With features like soft, flexible tubing and customizable settings, our pumps are crafted to minimize discomfort and make each session as gentle and efficient as possible.</p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "url": "",
            "link_text_2": "",
            "url_2": "",
            "hash": ""
          }
        },
        "link_QgTgAw": {
          "type": "link",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Flange Sizes and Fit",
            "icon": "",
            "content": "",
            "custom_liquid": "<p>Ensuring a proper fit with the right flange size is crucial for a comfortable and effective pumping experience. Breast pumps come with various flange sizes, typically ranging from 21mm to 36mm, to accommodate different breast shapes and sizes. Choosing a flange that fits comfortably around your nipple is essential, as a poor fit can cause discomfort and reduce milk flow.</p>\n<p>Ameda offers <a href=\"https://www.ameda.com/products/ameda-custom-fit-kits\">custom fit breast pump flanges</a>, allowing you to switch between different sizes as needed. This flexibility ensures that you can find the perfect fit for your body, enhancing both comfort and milk expression.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>For moms requiring smaller sizes, Ameda&rsquo;s <a href=\"https://www.ameda.com/collections/accessories/products/soft-breast-pump-flange-inserts\">Soft Flange Inserts</a> provide a customizable solution. Available in sizes from 11mm to 21mm, these soft silicone inserts fit easily into Ameda&rsquo;s standard 25mm flanges, allowing for quick adjustments to find the perfect fit. This flexibility enhances both comfort and milk expression, ensuring a gentle and effective pumping experience tailored to your needs.</p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "url": "",
            "link_text_2": "",
            "url_2": "",
            "hash": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "link_DxVWet",
        "link_QgTgAw"
      ],
