            "enable_media": false,
            "media_scale": 100,
            "heading": "Provide Additional Information",
            "text": "<p>After submitting the form, you may need to provide more details, such as your insurance plan information, prescription requirements, or other supporting documents. These details help us ensure a smooth approval process with your insurance provider.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_wzJtab": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "enable_media": false,
            "media_scale": 100,
            "heading": "Receive Contact from Our Providers",
            "text": "<p>Once all necessary information is submitted, our providers will reach out to guide you through the final steps. They will confirm any additional details, assist with ordering, and arrange for your pump to be shipped directly to you—often with free shipping.</p><p>Our customer service team is available to answer your questions and assist you throughout the process. Depending on your insurance coverage, you may also have access to hospital-based purchasing or rental options for added convenience.</p>",
