    "media_with_text_YrKhWd": {
      "type": "media-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_anD9DM": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why Choose Ameda?",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_KVerg6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Every mom's breastfeeding journey is unique, which is why Ameda offers a wide range of breast pumps to suit different needs and preferences. Our trusted collection empowers moms to enjoy a comfortable and efficient breastfeeding experience. Additionally, we partner with many insurance providers to help you get a breast pump at no cost if you qualify.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": true
          }
        }
