    "multi_column_hx4gVz": {
      "type": "multi-column",
      "blocks": {
        "column_3X7pxT": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "enable_media": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/nipple-shield_1_3.jpg",
            "media_scale": 100,
            "heading": "Breast Shields",
            "text": "<p>Available in multiple sizes, Ameda’s breast shields ensure a comfortable fit, helping to make your pumping sessions as efficient as possible.</p><p><a href=\"/products/ameda-washable-skin-to-skin-nipple-shield-for-breastfeeding\" title=\"Ameda Washable Skin-to-Skin Nipple Shield for Breastfeeding, Ultra-Thin Flexible Silicone, Cut-Out\">Breast Shields</a></p>",
            "button_label": "Breast Shields",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_zYErNb": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "enable_media": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/2-pack-5oz-milk-storage-bottles_2_1.jpg",
            "media_scale": 100,
            "heading": "Breast Milk Storage",
            "text": "<p>Safely store your expressed milk with Ameda’s storage bags and bottles, designed to protect the nutrients and freshness of your milk.</p><p><a href=\"/collections/breast-milk-storage\" title=\"Breast Milk Storage\">Breast Milk Storage</a></p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_CyhCqm": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "enable_media": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/custom_fit_flanges_2xl-2xxl-500x500.jpg",
            "media_scale": 100,
            "heading": "Breast Pump Flanges",
            "text": "<p>Our flanges are available in various sizes to provide a secure and comfortable fit, helping to maximize milk flow during pumping.</p><p><a href=\"/products/ameda-customfit-breast-pump-flanges-and-inserts-comfort-fit-angled-flange\" title=\"Ameda CustomFit Breast Pump Flanges™ and Inserts; Comfort Fit Angled Flange\">Flanges</a></p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_WBkXGw": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "enable_media": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/mya-kit.jpg",
            "media_scale": 100,
            "heading": "Accessories",
            "text": "<p>Explore our full range of <a href=\"https://www.ameda.com/collections/accessories\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">breast pump parts and accessories</span></a>, including <a href=\"https://www.ameda.com/products/ameda-hygienikit-silicone-replacement-tubing-2-count\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">tubing</span></a>, <a href=\"https://www.ameda.com/products/ameda-hygienikit-silicone-replacement-valves-2-count\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">valves</span></a>, and <a href=\"https://www.ameda.com/products/ameda-hygienikit-spare-parts-kit-for-breast-pump\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">spare parts</span></a>, to keep your breast pump running smoothly and enhance your overall pumping experience.</p><p><a href=\"/collections/accessories\" title=\"Pump Parts & Accessories\">Accessories</a></p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        }
      },
